{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/33611a9d2ee3c4b99f949c7375314c71.avif?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=480 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/3e8212ef627657eddc4a4d6dbe026d2d.avif?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=108 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Oracle\u2019s Call\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality fractures at the edge of the Warped Universe, a dreamlike cosmos where time twists, landscapes shift, and the balance of light and gravity determines all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoned by the Oracle, an enigmatic AI from a lost age, you are chosen to restore order to a collapsed universe. Align with the Luminaries, expanding the unknown through radiant light, and the Foundationalists, bending gravity to forge stability. Your choices shape the battlefield, warping physics, altering environments, and shifting the course of existence itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beyond the stars, the Void stirs\u2026 an ancient force of entropy that seeks to erase all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/e4944b14dd09452905f54d28ef282be5.avif?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=366 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Space at Your Pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warped Universe offers a blend of real-time action and turn-based strategy, allowing players to choose their preferred gameplay style for each mission. Enjoy seamless transitions between both genres, with shared weapons, skills, and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/54eb08fbfcf1bf496e645233dee3a4ba.avif?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-Time Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time action delivers fast-paced, third-person combat, perfect for players who thrive on quick reflexes. Jump into the action and let your instincts guide you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the moment matter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-Based Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based strategy offers a top-down game style, ideal for those who prefer a more tactical approach. Plan your moves carefully. Every turn counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/e3212931c65cc620a7979df1490e4eb9.poster.avif?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/e3212931c65cc620a7979df1490e4eb9.webm?t=1759493191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/e3212931c65cc620a7979df1490e4eb9.mp4?t=1759493191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >On the Ground or in Space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense combat planetside on open ground or in towering facilities, or take to the vast expanse of space for high-flying battles. Maneuver through tight corridors or navigate the stars, every mission is dynamic and full of opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/fcb7a7553f66088993e7cd3cf0b41bdc.poster.avif?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/fcb7a7553f66088993e7cd3cf0b41bdc.webm?t=1759493191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/fcb7a7553f66088993e7cd3cf0b41bdc.mp4?t=1759493191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unified Combat System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every attack\u2013in both real-time and turn-based modes\u2013follows the same underlying mechanics. Each hit is determined by a dice roll for balanced and consistent gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/6e074424da810a09c389353cc3153254.webp?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nexus Station</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Nexus Station is the central hub for players in Warped Universe, functioning as a vibrant social, strategic, and operational base. Within the station, players will find a variety of features that enhance both gameplay and interaction. The real-time 3D solar system map allows players to track planetary progress, monitor operational facilities, and scout for regions of space to expand the Oracle\u2019s reach. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workstations throughout the station allow players to acquire new equipment, apply cosmetics, and add upgrades to enhance their arsenal in preparation for what lurks beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/2d5ca2f7aa5520d18f611e2eb9a263a9.avif?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=416 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different Paths, Leading to a Singular Goal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Align with the Luminaries and Foundationalists to harness the powers of light and gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though distinct in their ideologies and approaches, both factions remain united in their ultimate goal: to navigate the challenges of the Warped Universe and forge a path forward for all its diverse inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/dea1258c6a244ba1d0b9c6044ac868fd.avif?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=334 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seasonal Solar Systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Warped Universe, seasonal gameplay will keep the experience fresh and ever-changing. As players complete missions and collect Residuum, they\u2019ll construct new planets and establish various facilities to unlock technologies, all while defending their creations from the Void\u2019s relentless threat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each season introduces new solar systems, missions, and technology to explore with lore updates that bring new environments, combatants, and cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/e05c4b665f35ce764dab2cae2ab06be1.webp?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose Your Playstyle \u2013 Seamlessly switch between real-time action and turn-based strategy in both ground and space combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the Universe \u2013 Use light and gravity to alter environments dynamically, warping battlefields in real time for all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving Narrative \u2013 Player choices shape the universe, affecting storylines, factions, and mission outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Shared Universe \u2013 Every player contributes to the season-wide meta-goal of building and defending the cosmos before time runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unified Combat System \u2013 Real-time and turn-based combat share the same underlying mechanics, ensuring consistency (every hit is determined by dice rolls).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op PvE Missions \u2013 Form teams of up to four players to battle the Void across ever-changing solar systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal Content \u2013 Expanding solar systems, evolving gameplay, and new challenges every season.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Warped Aesthetic \u2013 Psychedelic, painterly sci-fi visuals bring the universe to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/1bb05a085c00a9df9f3265eb652e708f.avif?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=430 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3277880?t=1759493191","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/2e072bcc83bc4065633b022c3944d46d1d4b13fb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759493191","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/7344aeb19db1fd1c332c2a77ab72e7c39f9804b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759493191","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/7344aeb19db1fd1c332c2a77ab72e7c39f9804b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759493191","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":