\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/54eb08fbfcf1bf496e645233dee3a4ba.avif?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-Time Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time action delivers fast-paced, third-person combat, perfect for players who thrive on quick reflexes. Jump into the action and let your instincts guide you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the moment matter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-Based Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based strategy offers a top-down game style, ideal for those who prefer a more tactical approach. Plan your moves carefully. Every turn counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/e3212931c65cc620a7979df1490e4eb9.poster.avif?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/e3212931c65cc620a7979df1490e4eb9.webm?t=1759493191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/e3212931c65cc620a7979df1490e4eb9.mp4?t=1759493191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >On the Ground or in Space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense combat planetside on open ground or in towering facilities, or take to the vast expanse of space for high-flying battles. Maneuver through tight corridors or navigate the stars, every mission is dynamic and full of opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/fcb7a7553f66088993e7cd3cf0b41bdc.poster.avif?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/fcb7a7553f66088993e7cd3cf0b41bdc.webm?t=1759493191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/fcb7a7553f66088993e7cd3cf0b41bdc.mp4?t=1759493191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unified Combat System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every attack\u2013in both real-time and turn-based modes\u2013follows the same underlying mechanics. Each hit is determined by a dice roll for balanced and consistent gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/6e074424da810a09c389353cc3153254.webp?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nexus Station</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Nexus Station is the central hub for players in Warped Universe, functioning as a vibrant social, strategic, and operational base. Within the station, players will find a variety of features that enhance both gameplay and interaction. The real-time 3D solar system map allows players to track planetary progress, monitor operational facilities, and scout for regions of space to expand the Oracle\u2019s reach. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workstations throughout the station allow players to acquire new equipment, apply cosmetics, and add upgrades to enhance their arsenal in preparation for what lurks beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/2d5ca2f7aa5520d18f611e2eb9a263a9.avif?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=416 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different Paths, Leading to a Singular Goal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Align with the Luminaries and Foundationalists to harness the powers of light and gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though distinct in their ideologies and approaches, both factions remain united in their ultimate goal: to navigate the challenges of the Warped Universe and forge a path forward for all its diverse inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/dea1258c6a244ba1d0b9c6044ac868fd.avif?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=334 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seasonal Solar Systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Warped Universe, seasonal gameplay will keep the experience fresh and ever-changing. As players complete missions and collect Residuum, they\u2019ll construct new planets and establish various facilities to unlock technologies, all while defending their creations from the Void\u2019s relentless threat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each season introduces new solar systems, missions, and technology to explore with lore updates that bring new environments, combatants, and cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/e05c4b665f35ce764dab2cae2ab06be1.webp?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose Your Playstyle \u2013 Seamlessly switch between real-time action and turn-based strategy in both ground and space combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the Universe \u2013 Use light and gravity to alter environments dynamically, warping battlefields in real time for all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving Narrative \u2013 Player choices shape the universe, affecting storylines, factions, and mission outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Shared Universe \u2013 Every player contributes to the season-wide meta-goal of building and defending the cosmos before time runs out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unified Combat System \u2013 Real-time and turn-based combat share the same underlying mechanics, ensuring consistency (every hit is determined by dice rolls).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op PvE Missions \u2013 Form teams of up to four players to battle the Void across ever-changing solar systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal Content \u2013 Expanding solar systems, evolving gameplay, and new challenges every season.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Warped Aesthetic \u2013 Psychedelic, painterly sci-fi visuals bring the universe to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/extras/1bb05a085c00a9df9f3265eb652e708f.avif?t=1759493191\" width=600 height=430 /></span></p>","developers":["Warped Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277880/c73ae90e9743965d7bfc7a6c969d05fdea6f38eb/header.jpg?t=1759493191","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3277880/211850319/6b71146f484b09768263e24e3a323d5a4eeb6b60